      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4 Bedroom Three-Storey Homes – Linenfield, Ballymakenny Road, Drogheda\r\n\r\nThese spacious four-bedroom, three-storey homes at Linenfield offer generous, flexible accommodation designed for modern family living. \r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 136 sq.m., the homes provide excellent living space over three floors, with a bright contemporary interior, well-proportioned bedrooms and plenty of room for growing families, home working or guests.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is centred around a comfortable living space and a modern kitchen/dining area with direct access to the private rear garden. Upstairs, the additional floors provide four generous bedrooms together with well-appointed bathroom accommodation.\r\n\r\nFinished to a high standard throughout, the homes feature modern kitchens, quality bathrooms, excellent insulation and energy-efficient heating, creating a comfortable and economical home.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n-Four-bedroom, three-storey family home\r\n-Approx. 136 sq.m.\r\n-Spacious and flexible accommodation\r\n-Contemporary kitchen and bathrooms\r\n-Bright living areas\r\n-Private rear garden\r\n-Energy-efficient new home\r\n-Excellent storage throughout\r\n-Located within the popular Linenfield development\r\n-Convenient to Drogheda town centre, schools, shops and transport links\r\n\r\nA superb opportunity to secure one of the largest house types within Linenfield."
      },
